WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:17.037
It was Yoo Jin's first day at school.

2
00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:22.057
Yoo Jin's mom kissed her cheek and patted her head.

3
00:00:22.058 --> 00:00:25.587
"Don't be scared, sweetheart," Mom said.

4
00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:41.130
"School is fun."

5
00:00:41.131 --> 00:00:43.740
Yoo Jin held her new bag.

6
00:00:43.741 --> 00:00:50.323
She had new pencils, books, and erasers.

7
00:00:50.324 --> 00:00:59.356
Yoo Jin was happy and scared.

8
00:00:59.357 --> 00:01:02.263
Yoo Jin saw the big girls.

9
00:01:02.264 --> 00:01:05.012
They were on the swings.

10
00:01:05.013 --> 00:01:08.903
They were on the seesaw.

11
00:01:08.904 --> 00:01:10.889
The girls skipped.

12
00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:15.004
They sang, "Dance, laugh, and learn too.

13
00:01:15.005 --> 00:01:16.476
Come and play!

14
00:01:16.477 --> 00:01:23.367
Don't be blue!"

15
00:01:23.368 --> 00:01:27.913
Yoo Jin ran to the girls.

16
00:01:27.914 --> 00:01:31.215
She sat on the seesaw.

17
00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:35.658
She got on the swing.

18
00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:39.167
Yoo Jin skipped.

19
00:01:39.168 --> 00:01:43.624
Yoo Jin sang, "Dance, laugh, and learn too.

20
00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:44.943
Come and play.

21
00:01:44.944 --> 00:01:47.807
Don't be blue!"

22
00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:51.217
It was Yoo Jin's first day of school.

23
00:01:51.218 --> 00:01:56.379
She loved it!
